{"version":1,"content":"<p>「十優港姐」麥明詩9月初跟「大美人」關之琳合照，並在10月1日在社交平台分享靚相，但麥明詩被指P圖只P自己，今天（19日）她在Ig還原真相，並展示當天手機的影相數據，她又否認自己是女神，麥明詩寫道：「其實我自己都好鍾意睇threads，大家吹吓水、亂噏吓，一笑置之，睇開threads嘅讀者都有自己判斷能力。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:39:47.540557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:23:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:37:43.051635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:38:05.593378+00:00","content_hash":"8160bc19255b5b266cf29d1d64e3e68de2d3a55b0d1e0418d013ab6bcd1a41b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}